data: {"id": "4f14fc0af9f2465f-thinking-parallel_evidence-760", "run_id": "4f14fc0af9f2465f", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "现在我已经获得了所有关键证据。让我整理分析：\n\n## 证据采集结论\n\n### 已确认事实\n\n**1. Kubernetes 状态 (kubectl_describe & kubectl_get_by_name)**\n- Pod `aiops-case-v03/workload` 当前状态为 **Pending**，未调度到任何节点 (`node: <none>`, `IP: <none>`)\n- 容器 `app` 使用镜像 `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`，资源请求极低 (CPU 5m, Memory 8Mi)\n- **核心事件**：50 分钟前开始，持续触发 `FailedScheduling`，原因明确为：\n  ```\n  persistentvolumeclaim \"unavailable-claim\" not found\n  ```\n- Pod spec 中包含 Volume 挂载：`input` 指向 PVC `unavailable-claim`\n\n**2. Prometheus Metrics (e", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789116759632, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

