data: {"id": "4f14fc0af9f2465f-final", "run_id": "4f14fc0af9f2465f", "seq": 765, "ts_ms": 1789116775637, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v03/workload` | Pending | Pod aiops-case-v03/workload stuck in Pending state since 50m ago |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning FailedScheduling 50m default-scheduler 0/3 nodes are available: persistentvolumeclaim \"unavailable-claim\" not found...` (fact-1a526a6a1a7d) | 明确失败机制：调度器因找不到 PVC 拒绝调度。 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning FailedScheduling 24m (x5 over 44m) default-scheduler 0/3 nodes are available: persistentvolumeclaim \"unavailable-claim\" not found...` (fact-f15a9f32875b) | 确认该失败为持续性故障，且重试了多次。 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | Pod `aiops-case-v03/workload` 状态：`Pending` (fact-f44de9f95e6f) | 确认可见现象为 Pod 停滞在 Pending 状态。 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_status_phase` 在 phase=Pending 的标签下值为 `1` (fact-a44d83266441) | 量化确认 Pod 当前处于 Pending 阶段。 |\n| 5 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_status_phase` 在 phase=Running 的标签下值为 `0` (fact-2750113fdc81) | 确认 Pod 从未成功进入 Running 阶段。 |\n\n**证据印证：** K8s Event 提供了根本原因的精确描述（找不到 PVC `unavailable-claim`），解释了调度器为何在所有 3 个节点上均返回 `FailedScheduling`。K8s State 确认 Pod 处于 Pending 状态，而 Metric 数据进一步佐证了 Pod 长期处于非运行阶段（Pending 计数为 1，Running 为 0）。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n```text\nPVC 'unavailable-claim' 不存在 → default-scheduler 调度阶段无法绑定卷 → 持续触发 FailedScheduling (0/3 nodes available) → Pod aiops-case-v03/workload 陷入 Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n根因是 `aiops-case-v03` 命名空间中引用了缺失的 PersistentVolumeClaim `unavailable-claim`（证据 #1, #2）。由于该 PVC 不存在，Kubernetes 的 `default-scheduler` 在尝试分配 Pod 时无法完成卷绑定，导致在所有节点上调度失败（证据 #1, #2）。这一机制直接导致 Pod `aiops-case-v03/workload` 持续停留在 `Pending` 状态（证据 #3, #4, #5）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 48.6s\n├─ 问题定位: 14.1s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 25.3s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v03/workload: 25.3s (Evidence 18.5s, RCA 6.6s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.2s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v03/workload**: pod-pending-unschedulable\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 48.627, "metrics": {"run_id": "4f14fc0af9f2465f", "mttr": {"value": "48.6s", "seconds": 48.633421897888184, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-pending-unschedulable", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-pending-unschedulable"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 48633.42189788818, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 46014.51802253723, "tool_calls": 13, "executed_tool_calls": 8, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 4, "successful_tool_calls": 12, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 5542.880535125732, "tool_wall_duration_ms":